      * RPG III data areas: DEFN *NAMVAR, IN, OUT, UNLCK (FREE-17)
     H
     IMYDS         DS
     I                                        1  10 DSFLD
      * A data structure, a field declared before, a field declared after the DEFN
     C           *NAMVAR   DEFN *LDA      MYDS
     C                     Z-ADD0         TOTAL   90
     C           *NAMVAR   DEFN TOTDA     TOTAL
     C           *NAMVAR   DEFN CNTDA     CNT
     C                     Z-ADD0         CNT     50
      * IN, OUT, UNLCK
     C           *LOCK     IN   TOTAL
     C                     OUT  TOTAL
     C                     IN   MYDS
     C                     IN   TOTAL                  90
     C           *LOCK     OUT  TOTAL                  91
     C                     IN   *NAMVAR
     C                     OUT  *NAMVAR
     C                     UNLCKTOTAL
      * Not converted
     C           *NAMVAR   DEFN GHOSTD    GHOST
     C           *NAMVAR   DEFN LENDA     LENF    5
     C                     IN   NODA
     C           *LOCK     IN   MYDS
     C                     IN   TOTAL     X
     C           *NAMVAR   DEFN TOTDA     TOTAL
     C                     OCUR MYDS
